ection></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 推免生在拟录取后可提前选择本年度具有招生资格的导师，提前接受导师指导，并提早进入课题研究工作。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 学校已构建比较完备的研究生奖助体系，包括国家奖学金、国家助学金、学校学业奖学金及“三助”岗位津贴等相关配套政策措施在内的研究生奖助办法。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>二、申请条件</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 具有良好的思想品德和政治素质，遵纪守法；勤奋学习，刻苦钻研；学术研究兴趣浓厚，有较强的创新意识、创新能力；在校期间未受过任何处分；身心健康，综合素质高。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 2026届普通全日制本科毕业生，具备研究生培养潜质，学风端正，有望取得本科所在学校的推荐免试生资格。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>三、招生专业</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/mmecoa_jpg/wjkK2mkSqHC9zw6GwibvMrsLAoTzGE7psvN2z6dJJv0QcT1qrQPiaW2Ngd7NoibhIibEFMicRjR7ZcMlpW6AhmJJOxw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span></span></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>四、申请材料</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 个人自述材料（简历、自荐信等）；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 本人有效身份证、学生证；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>3. 在校学习成绩单（加盖学校教务处或院系公章）；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>4. 本人最高英语水平证明材料（成绩单）；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>5. 学术科研成果（公开发表的论文、出版的专著等，提交论文封面、目录、全文）及获奖证书；</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>6. 其他可反映自身能力和水平的相关材料。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>请将上述材料扫描合并为1个PDF文件后上传，文件命名为“报考专业+考生姓名”。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>五、申请流程</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>（一）预报名参加提前考核</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong><span><span>1. 符合报考条件的考生，即日起至9月15日17:00，有意向的考生可与学院负责人联系，将申请材料发送至指定邮箱。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 对预报名考生材料进行初审后，筛选、择优确定考核名单，向申请人发放考核通知。请申请人关注学院官网并保持电话畅通。</span></span></strong></p><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><strong><span>（二）正式报名</span></strong></section></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section></section></section></section></section><p><strong><span><span>所有意向报考我院的推免生，务必在规定时间内登录“全国推荐免试攻读研究生（免初试、转段）信息公开管理服务系统”（简称“推免服务系统”，http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm暂未开通）填报我校，并及时接收和确认学院的“复试通知”及“待录取通知”。未按规定履行手续的按自动放弃处理。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><strong><span>六、其它</span></strong></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>1. 如发现申请人存在材料不真实或不具备推免生资格等弄虚作假情况的，当即取消申请人考核资格或拟录取资格。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2. 入学前未取得学士学位或本科毕业证书，或受到处分的，取消拟录取资格。</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>3. 联系方式</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>蒋老师：010-88803748</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>王老师：010-88803980</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>邮箱：wy@ncut.edu.cn</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>4. 学院网站:https://sem.ncut.edu.cn/</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p><strong><span><span>北方工业大学经济管理学院</span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>2025年9月9日</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/